```console
$ scherzo-cloud runner activation create --help
Create a single-use runner activation

Usage: scherzo-cloud runner activation create [OPTIONS] --activation-file <PATH|-> <ORGANIZATION> <RUNNER>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <RUNNER>        Runner ID or exact name

Options:
      --activation-file <PATH|->  Create the protected artifact file, or write only the artifact to stdout
      --json                      Print the runner result as JSON
      --allow-insecure-http       Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                      Print help

```
